<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans down in March 12 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans down in March 12 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 12</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............802,400 down...2,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......700,300 down...1,900</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......539,000 down...3,900</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....819,805 up.....2,690</p>
<p> Financial companies.......634,269 up.......897</p>
<p> New York business loans....44,940 down...1,058</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......44,670 down...1,075</p>
</text>
